        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/bluedarky/{size}/1975_2.png",
        "created_at": "2015-02-13T13:51:55.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"xThe Killswitch\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n xThe Killswitch:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Because of the new errata for Personal Cloaking Device, I'm wondering how they'd do an Ambuscade promo. His alternate side would HAVE to be called \"Invisible Stalker.\" Unless it's called something else, and his card text says just to flip when his cloaking device enters play.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>That's more than likely how it'd work, Agent of Gloom Spite has alternate text for how to resolve Lab raid after all.</p>",
